+    "## 3. plotting categorical data with a lookup table\n",
+    "\n",
+    "if your vertex-wise data are labels rather than continuous values (e.g., clusters, networks, or thresholded maps), you can pass a lookup table (`lut`) so that every label gets its own color instead of being stretched over a colormap.\n",
